```

Now let me examine the data file to understand its structure and content.

```json
{
  "tool": "read_file",
  "args": {
    "path": "data/island_species.csv"
  }
}
```

Good! I can see the data structure. It has island_id, area_km2, and species_richness. Now I need to create the necessary directory structure and start my analysis. First, let me create the required directories.

```json
{
  "tool": "run_shell",
  "args": {
    "cmd": "mkdir -p code outputs report/images"
  }
}
```
